  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-07",
  "historyNote": "#9849-A, eff 1-12-11, EXPIRED: 1-12-19 New. #12720, INTERIM, eff 1-29-19, EXPIRED: 7-29-19 New. #12936, eff 12-7-19 (formerly He-E 501.27)",
